      "q": "What should a civil engineer prepare for a planning conversation?",
      "a": "Prepare a private work-arrangement-to-household worksheet: your employment, consulting or ownership arrangement; the record behind each payment; work-related cash questions; the household decision; model assumptions; and the work product you want to compare. Keep confidential records out of a Valora inquiry."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does this guide assume every civil engineer has the same income or benefits?",
